elp  Karen the young woman ends up dead of a  gunshot wound with Bart apparently the  only person thereby from there things  only get twistier and we won't spoil  what happens next you might be asking  yourself how you've never heard of this  movie before well that's a very  complicated question the night clerk  failed to secure theatrical distribution  on its release the flick was released  directly to VOD platforms in February  2020 with virtually no advertising or  promotion to speak off with a  many of us still staying at home  whenever possible due to the ongoing  corona virus pandemic a lot of obscure  movies are getting their shots at the  spotlight and in the case of the night  clerk audiences are liking what they're  seeing the movie was only just released  to Netflix on June 6th and it took  virtually no time at all for it to  become one of the streamers most watched  titles there's a reason for that it's a  nifty little murder mystery  featuring excellent performances from  Sheridan and Damas two actors who stars  are decidedly on the rice you can catch  Sheridan next in the sci-fi thriller  voyages which is expected to be released  in November of 2020 the armours will  next appear in the 25th James Bond film  no time to die also slated for release  in November although the night clerk has  climbed its way up the Netflix rankings  ladder  it's at the lower end of the scale when  it comes to critical reviews the flick  has a rotten score on the review  aggregator Rotten Tomatoes and this  critical consensus paints it as having a  quote poorly conceived story and not  even its quote a pair of charismatic  leads can bring to life still while the  night clerk may not have poured in rave  reviews it's certainly poured of viewers  in on Netflix potentially by the  millions there must be a reason for that  so why not check it out for yourself and  if you end up disappointed thankfully  there are a ton of other mystery movies  to watch on Netflix check out one of